Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,You studied Arabic for a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.40,0:00:05.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Then a taxi driver in Cairo asked you something,\Nand you caught none of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:07.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,That's because the textbook taught you Fusha.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.20,0:00:10.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Nobody speaks Fusha at the shop,\Nor out to dinner with friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.00,0:00:10.00,OnScreen,,0,0,0,,{\fnNoto Naskh Arabic\fs96}فصحى{\fs70}{\fnMontserrat ExtraBold} ≠ what people say
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:13.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,Hikaya teaches the Arabic people actually speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.50,0:00:19.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Pick Gulf, Egyptian or Yemeni,\Nand scroll short clips of native speakers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.50,0:00:19.00,OnScreen,,0,0,0,,Gulf · Egyptian · Yemeni
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.00,0:00:21.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lost on a word? Tap it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.00,0:00:26.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,You get the English, the literal meaning,\Neven how it would look in Fusha.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.50,0:00:29.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,One more tap saves it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.00,0:00:29.00,OnScreen,,0,0,0,,Tap any word
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.00,0:00:35.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Saved words come back as flashcards\Nright before you'd forget them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.00,0:00:40.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,Then say it yourself. Shadow the line,\Nget a score, see which sound to fix.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.50,0:00:45.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Stuck? Ask the tutor.\NIt knows which line you're on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.00,0:00:45.00,OnScreen,,0,0,0,,Say it. Fix one sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.00,0:00:52.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Start with the alphabet,\Nor jump straight into the clips. It's free.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.00,0:00:52.00,OnScreen,,0,0,0,,Free to start
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:19.00,Label,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,860)}SCREEN RECORDING
